  "term": "runway",
  "definition": "In this source, Runway refers to Runway ML, an AIGC tool used to generate dynamic images as part of an automated system for creating emotion-based animations. It supports controllable visual expression by helping map emotional, behavioral, and style-related information into animated output.",
